# PROBE top-subsumes-everything. ⊤ ⊑ A makes every class, B included, a subclass of A.
# construct: SubClassOf
# expect: sub :B :A

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:A a owl:Class . :B a owl:Class .
owl:Thing rdfs:subClassOf :A .
